{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_8_level_main_08-17_end","groupId":"main_8","stageId":"main_08-17","title":"昂首，足践烈焰","storyCode":"JT8-3","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-17_end.txt","sourceHash":"a294b156aadfa659c3181a163dc2f30acb16776fd876f1b3e6eb0e1c20b7f0e5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"“不死的黑蛇”以塔露拉的生命要挟两人，它知道，如果塔露拉死了，那么战争依然会爆发。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“不死的黑蛇”","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"做得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“不死的黑蛇”","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"做得真好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“不死的黑蛇”","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？斩龙的剑没能斩我，魔王的剑没能刺穿我，为什么......我的法术......我的掌控力，还在消退？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"火焰正逐渐消退。虽然那温度依然足以杀人，但已不再有数分钟前那样暴烈。\n陈染血的手颤抖不止。她几乎不再眨眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你感到欣喜吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这滋味好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们如此接近胜利，表情却为何还这样凝重？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"胜利近在你们眼前......不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"法术解开了......能说话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，别大意。我们的体力也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想要将我自这具身躯中驱除？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"请吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是在嘲蔑谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王，魔王，你为何一言不发？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"将我逐出她的身体，你们，你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你能做得到的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"审判她与审判我又有什么区别？难道这一切不是我犯下的罪恶吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"魔王？回答我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的没错，科西切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她完完全全不愿意的话，那些事......你是做不了的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"属于你的那些想法......无论是不是被扭曲过，那都确实来自......塔露拉本人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_12"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你想伤害塔露拉小姐的肉体？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你要做什么？！把剑放下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你见过有人在你面前自刎吗，“妹妹”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是德拉克的肉体也没可能承受这把剑的锋利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我做不了她不想做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，塔露拉还能继续活下去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你想都别想！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"她心底的绝望，无法摆脱的耻辱，是否足够浓郁，浓郁到让她想要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"自尽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科西切！你对塔露拉小姐做的一切......都是没法被原谅的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管你是不是只是她身上的一个影子，或者是她苏醒的一个障碍，还是说你就是她的另一面......无论塔露拉犯了多少错，你都不可能是对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在“教育”她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我的失败源自我依然还存在的坚持。等你们遇到没有坚持的人就会了解到，痛苦这个词汇里，到底包含多少东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"就像她那些可悲的成为了她牺牲品的乌萨斯战士们，也只是她脚下的坚实道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这些感染者，这些可悲的感染者，明明是该发挥它们那世俗不容的价值的感染者们......现在也浪费了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是我也只是她脚下的路。如果我成功杀了你的话，“妹妹”......之后就不会有那么多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以说我们是黑蛇，也可以说，我就是塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"陈晖洁呀，陈晖洁。塔露拉与我也只是各式父女中的其中一种罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"也许魏彦吾与我也很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你还好意思这么说？！牺牲自己的“女儿”？他和你一点都不像！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对......你不能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"已经晚了，魔王。我不会让我的秘密被你们拿下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"科西切，你想杀死陈小姐，是因为你想彻底杀死塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在，你做不到了。我们唤起的她的记忆，已经在她脑海中回荡了足够长的时间。她没办法再忍受了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉小姐！请你记住......请你回想起来你自己是谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论是怎样的牺牲，如果是你的话......你才会是那个想第一个去为了他们牺牲的人不是吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想一想霜星，想一想浮士德......想一想所有相信你的战士，以及想一想你自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真的想就这样被我们取走生命吗......！以这副任人摆弄的身体死去，你不会心甘情愿的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你要是感到悔恨，要是会因此感到罪恶，也应该作为你自己，而不是一个诅咒的承载体，一个远古邪恶的受害者来承担......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕你想要死去，你也得作为塔露拉而死！作为那个想要改变雪原，改变感染者命运的塔露拉而死！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉小姐，我知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你不是为了事业成功才去为了感染者而战的......哪怕失败了那也没有关系！你这么做，是因为你认为这么做是对的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，无论我们面对的是怎么样的人、怎么样的大地......我们不都是会走下去，走到我们真的能够倒下为止吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不就是这样坚定的人吗......你所认识的，不都是那样坚定的人吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你就甘心做这条蛇的傀儡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你就甘心这样结束？这是我认识的塔露拉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样也配做......感染者的领袖吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"难道......说......塔露拉小姐......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"这绝不是白发的德拉克第一次反抗自己的“父亲”。\n感染者的领袖......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他教育给自己的一切都是他的阴谋。而阴谋是赤裸裸的表达。\n即使她知道这一切，但她还是没能阻止自己。\n在她憎恨那些她无法忍受的事情之前，她首先......\n憎恨自己。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"够了。到这里就可以了。我已经不再是你了，科西切。我和你是不同的......我不是另一条黑蛇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我也许像个科西切......但我不是另一条黑蛇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的诅咒必须在今天断绝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我的仇恨已经杀了太多人了。你休想再用仇恨去煽动我哪怕一分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵，科西切，你所承载的你那无数代的仇怨和故事......在我这一代就会结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是种子，你是藤蔓，你是参天大树......没关系，科西切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可是火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“是我教给你这一切”？不，不，科西切，这片大地，那片雪原，那些追逐阳光的人，他们教给我的东西，你永远不可能理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"能够驾驭我力量的人早就在那了。即使你让我失去了他们......你也不可能再操控我的情感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的火会把你我一同烧穿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......居然！你想反对我？你怎么能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......我怎么可能让你从我的尖牙中逃走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不是因为阴谋破产而气恼，而是因为发现自己控制不了这个人而恼怒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"控制？她是我......我就是她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那是当然的，科西切......德拉克的女儿怎么会像你这条爬虫一样阴暗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"陈，陈小姐？那个话可不能......不能让斐迪亚干员们听见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。我也曾经有个蛇上司，她可是个心口如一的人......不打紧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你，科西切，你失败的原因只有一个，那就是你不配。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你不配占据我姐姐的身体。你不配去发动一场战争。甚至，你根本配不上你所说的你的经历。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，现在，给我从塔露拉的身体里......滚出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"看来真得在离开之前......你们难道真以为你们能阻止核心城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"——不可以！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"只要我在这里结束这条生命，这一切依然会流动向前，你们怎么阻止得了乌萨斯——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"......难道她不是你的女......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"还在追索我的情感？混种的魔王......即使这是事实，你也没有把它说出来的资格！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，但你说的也对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"终归会有下一个切尔诺伯格和下一个清醒的傀儡，也会有下一个塔露拉的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我就承认，这一次，你们就尽情庆祝自己的壮举吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"无所谓......已经无所谓了。记好了，塔露拉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"“即使在这大地的尽头也会有我。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"白发的德拉克颓然跪倒在地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"......结束了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉？","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还不能确定这......是不是那条老蛇的诡计，不知道塔露拉是不是真的在脑海里除掉他了，还是说她真的对自己做的这些感到后悔了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，不，还没结束......我们还得把这座城市停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"想停下城市就把那东西给我，兔子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"什么......？W？你是从哪里......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"秘钥！再不弄的话就来不及了！不把这个大铁块停下，大家一起完蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不能相信一个敌人。杀害了我们罗德岛同僚的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你要怎么相信我？这样吧，读我的心好了。别人要这么做我会让他们从脚底板开始开花，但现在的话，给你看一两眼也没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，兔子......你不相信我也没关系。我也不信你。但我相信特蕾西娅的继承人不至于在这时候犯傻！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你肯把东西给我，城市停下以后你杀了我也行。我不会站在那给你杀的，但我可以给你个机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"要知道，大多数人我根本不会给这个机会的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我无法信任一个杀人狂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"那你应该信不过自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"的确。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"W，再说一句让我信得过的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你，这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，为了这片大地......能够安稳入眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_087","isRemote":false,"text":"....."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅，对我来说，梦想是一个遥不可及的东西。啊，每天处理这处理那，真的好累好累。\n但我是有那样一个梦的。这个梦让我觉得，无论我在这里投入多少精力，都是有意义的。\n如果晚上睡觉的时候有爸爸妈妈在身边，阿米娅是不是会开心许多呢？\n是的，是的。唉，我知道的，可能会闹矛盾吧？\n因为白天打翻家具晚上挑食的事情闹脾气什么的，也是可能的。可不要和凯尔希闹脾气哦，她不是有心那样的。我知道，乖孩子。\n是的，不管怎么样，我们总会因为有爸爸妈妈在所以放心一些的。\n在黑暗里，爸爸妈妈就像是一盏台灯吧。角落里藏着的黑色怪物，窗外的滴着口水的野兽，都会被爸爸妈妈赶走的。\n更想他们了？哎，我......\n没事，没事。阿米娅，没事。有我在这儿呢。\n没事的，阿米娅。因为爸爸妈妈肯定也是这样想的。哪怕平常有很多烦心事，在看着宝宝的时候，父母也是会想许多的。\n有的时候，这是我们活下去的唯一理由了。因为......生命在我们死后依然能够延续，不是因为别的，而是因为有人能活下去。这是支撑着我们向前走的理由。\n我不想孩子失去父母，也不希望父母失去孩子。\n这片大地上，随意夺走别人生命的事不断地重复，总有些什么会夺走我们爱的那些人，夺走那些支撑着我们走下去的人......\n那些事情，甚至会发生在亲子之间。只因为一些词语，一些想法......他们之间竟然充满了仇恨。\n因为受伤流出来的血是没法灌溉农田的。一年又一年积压出的痛是不会结出甜果子的。\n阿米娅，我们是很脆弱的。我们的泪水会流进沙土，种子也不会在那里发芽。\n所以，我有一个很远很远的梦想。\n我想这片大地上的居民不再只是为着离别和失去哭泣，我不想我们的夜空被心碎和空虚塞满。\n我想着，也许有一天......我们会一起让这片大地上的每一个人，都能平静入梦。\n嗯，每一个人。我们也是其中的一部分。\n哪怕那个未来不会来，哪怕这片大地会陷入黑暗也一样。阿米娅，我们活在这里，不是为了一个答案。\n现在，罗德岛还在它的航线上呜呜地开着。一切都照常运行，哪怕我们到不了终点。\n睡吧，晚安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"兔子，不......阿米娅！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"让我，这一次就让我再为议长做些什么吧！让我为这些还没死的人，做些什么吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"就帮我这一次！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_39"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅手中的黑色长剑缓缓化作飞灰，在风中散去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。W，这一次我相信你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......为了这片大地能够安稳入眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"靠你了，W。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯女孩将一个盒子推进了萨卡兹的手中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷子，你的临终心愿我也知道，就让我他妈把这座城给你停......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......？在哪输口令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，这钥匙......什么东西？这钥匙根本就......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"指令明白","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯语）警告，权限不足。此秘钥只能用于启动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"权限不够是什么玩意儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"听我说，这玩意虽然是个钥匙......但是......没用。这把钥匙权限不够。连市长都没有权限，这机器要谁才能停？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，从头到尾，所有人都被......都被骗了......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是移动城市核心城一定有紧急制动钥匙！除非，除非......除非钥匙已经被烧......烧掉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......不对。不对！米莎......？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还不至于。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"钥匙在我这。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你这龙女......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。哈，你准不准备给我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是打算把你那个邪恶计划坚持到底——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"接住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，到手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的你......还挺直爽的，我开始有点喜欢你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"油嘴滑舌的萨卡兹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"把它直接按在控制面板上，你知道之后该怎么做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"口令我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅，站稳了，我可不知道这是不是一闸到底！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么念来着......唔，（乌萨斯语）为了喂饱所有人民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"对......是那个口令。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这把钥匙，你是从哪里得到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......这把钥匙原本就挂在制动室的墙上。只要有口令，谁都能用。只是因为从没人想过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......没想过这么荒诞的发展和这么残酷的骗局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"为了支走游击队，为了诱骗近卫局，这几把秘钥......根本只是我哄骗他们的谎言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我利用了他们对大移动城市的不了解，利用了碎骨和爱国者的信任，明明这是......他们最后一次信任我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"（乌萨斯语）为了喂饱所有人民。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"5:42p.m.\n这个铁块不情愿地轰鸣着，放慢了它冲向毁灭的脚步。\n终于，切尔诺伯格核心城停在了龙门的舰炮射程之外。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"也没我想象中那么危险，只能说，好在我们还能把它停下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"咻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"......龙女，你居然没毁掉钥匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，不说话装哑巴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——因为她不想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"科西切肯定千方百计地想诱导她，想让她把这把钥匙毁掉，但是他做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因为......有那么一点无法抹去，或者说没法被法术动摇的良知在那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"可能因为她是从没想过。即使她曾经因为一念之差想过要毁掉所有人，却也从来没想要断掉那条路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那条感染者至少还能挣扎着活下去的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......站起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"别这样。你已经够让人失望了。站起来，塔露拉！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_13"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"站起来，塔露拉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你面对的是什么？你自己不是说过吗，不管你是真心的还是假心假意的，不管你是自己说的还是借别人的嘴巴说的，你自己知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你说你的敌人是这片腐朽的大地。你知道这意味着什么吗，塔露拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，你比我更明白......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"为了感染者，不，为了打碎感染者和普通人之间的这面高墙，为了消灭那些丑陋的谋杀和恶毒的奴役。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"和感染者们一起战斗了多少年的你，当然会比我更明白......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你明白的，面对这片大地，你毫无胜算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有一点取胜的机会......他们会压倒你，污蔑你，溺死你，唾弃你，欺骗你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要敢站出来，他们就敢把你拖进最肮脏的地方里，用最污秽的办法去对付你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要犯下一个错误就会被打倒，你的敌人却无穷无尽。你选择走上前来，选择和他们对抗，选择投进你的生命，你的敌人却不朽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你只有一个结局，你会被打倒，你会被毁掉，哪怕你只走错一步！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你只要走错一步，这一步就成了他们伤害你的理由......名正言顺地伤害你的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"他们就像恶兽闻到血腥味一样扑上来，撕扯你的肉，扒掉你的舌头和眼睛，还嚎叫着侮辱你的尊严！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但人怎么可能不犯错？所以你一定会倒下。你会被打倒在地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......但你不能，你比我还清楚，塔露拉，你不能倒下......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他们都盯着你！就算他们都瞄着你身上所有的弱点，就算他们都想着扯开你的外皮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"就算他们要把你的一切都挂出来嘲笑和唾弃，侮蔑你是废物和欲望过剩的幼稚混球......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不能倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们在各自的城市里活成了对方不知道的样子。过去的日子不会再来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已经有了各自的事业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，我没有做到......你也没有做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"明明路还很长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我们的事情还没做完。即使这事业没有结束的那天也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你应该比我更懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"塔露拉，你的路，一样很长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哗，厉害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞪了W一眼。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哎？算了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"警官不再言语。\n因为战士站了起来。慢慢地，她站了起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_14_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"你什么时候变得这么牙尖爪利了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"真该让阿丽娜也看看你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你终于愿意开口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——在这之前，我要先逮捕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"谁会审判我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"还没有人。乌萨斯和龙门......都没有审判你的资格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我还没有落魄到要被亲人包庇，在耻辱中苟延残喘的地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"错了，塔露拉。是因为这片大地上还没有那个足够公正，足够审判你的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"足够审判感染者的地方，到现在都还不存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的理想吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......建立那个能够公平审判所有人，无论他们是谁，来自哪里，有没有得病的那个地方？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是理想。这是我的工作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见，姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我救到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但我也不会束手就擒的。即使......是现在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不敢死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以......弥补。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么都不能弥补。我在一个冬天里毁掉了无数人的一切。任何一个人都没有资格去弥补什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我还......不能死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我不能死。我死了就是结束。我死了就是让他们得逞，就是让那些只有我还记着名字的人死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你会活下去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"也许我不配。但我不配在这里死去，我根本配不上这么轻而易举地一死了之。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"——这片大地是不能重来的。发生过的都发生过了，没发生的还会继续发生，坠下的雨水湿润土地，死去的一切都不会再回。 ​​​"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......我要活着。要活到我有资格为他们殉死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_14"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候我们玩过一个游戏。脸三分，胸口五分，腰两分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道魏彦吾为什么会教我们那个。但我觉得还挺有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我在学校里被其他小孩打了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你护着碧翠克斯。你被打得很惨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是被你打的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的我两下就能制服你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"......你试试。你的确变得很好强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"把剑放下吧，你拿那个其实有点好笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那么大家就空手。顺便，这把赤霄是圆了你的什么侠客美梦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"“美食美酒美景，美人美善美谈”，你得着那些稀奇古怪的小说里的哪个梦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！别说了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"​​你不会还在看那些吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......我一定打得你说不出话来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"谢她，不要谢我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你该谢的是那只勇敢的小兔子，以及那些和她并肩战斗的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"她才是那个凭着良知一步一步踩着你的熔岩和火焰走到这儿的人。这个阿米娅才是真正救了你的人。​"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"那之前......先解决我们两个之间的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":"char_011_talula","isRemote":false,"text":"我们间就只剩那么一点东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陈","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"不，塔露拉。未来还长。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，她们......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"没事的，小兔子。每个人都有一个要被打得粉碎的过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐，我想知道......为什么你会知道停止核心城的制动口令？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都得有些秘密渠道吧？这个答案我一点也不想回答。你会杀了我吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"但看在你刚才相信我的份上，我可以回答你......如果你不生气的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你是说米莎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是亚历克斯。碎骨。嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"是他父亲在死前和他这么说的。他的父亲并不傻。整合运动要做什么，他大概也知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"但他没有能力阻止什么，就像他既没有阻止乌萨斯屠杀他的同事，也没能阻止自己的儿女双双死去。哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"只是那时我们都没能理解，至少我到刚刚才理解......在这之前，科西切这个老骗子骗了我们所有人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我，爱国者老爷子，霜星，浮士德，梅菲斯特，碎骨，弑君者，全都被骗了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"米莎原本是不用死的。我一开始为了让切城动不起来，就那么害了她，后来又因为停不下切城，后悔杀了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"就那个时候，我已经觉得我的白痴会毁掉所有人，幸亏那龙女还算有点良知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的错。对了，我可不会乞求原谅什么的。当时我可一点没觉得自己做错了什么事。如果每个人都按常理办事，这片大地早死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"但是米莎已经死去了。我们永远没法弥补这个错误。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"W，以后这一切都不会再发生。我不会允许你再这样做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"你要么答应我，要么，我们会把你囚禁在罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你尝试去拯救许多人......但一个人也是人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，看来塔露拉已经体力不支。那样纵容自己身体释放的法术，可不会让她有多好过的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。她倒下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我有没有说过，嗯，怎么说呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"小兔子，嗯。小兔子，你有点像她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"再见了，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_npc_046","isRemote":false,"text":"真心希望，呵呵，我真心希望我这种人不会再和你见面。不要再见面了，罗德岛的兔子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，W！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"停下了......切尔诺伯格停下了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"做得好！做得好罗德岛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"敌人在撤退......？敌人陷入混乱了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"要追吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"他们在四处逃窜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛近卫干员？","speakerId":"avg_npc_059","isRemote":false,"text":"他们感受到了。他们被抛弃了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"我们胜了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":"avg_npc_042","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我们做到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_058","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈！！我们感染者齐力同心！就是这样！这一切都亏了你们！罗德岛！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_8_15"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"万岁！小猫！你真厉害！我们做到了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"盾卫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"万岁！！罗德岛的菲林！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迷迭香","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......哈哈......哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"Ace，Scout，我好像做到了。\n我好像理解了。我不是只有家人的。\n这片大地上......还有好人。还有好多......温柔的人。\n很温暖。真的很温暖。\n温暖的事情，也许......我不会忘。我不该忘。哪怕痛苦，我也......努力记住。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_topburning"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们终于到了！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来的是时候。阿米娅做到了。不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，博士！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"见到你真是......太好了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"糟糕！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅！！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陈"]},{"speakerId":"char_011_talula","aliases":["“不死的黑蛇”","塔露拉","塔露拉？"]}]}
